<TITLE>Thermostat</TITLE>
<LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM><PTXT>The thermostat is installed in the water inlet.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>The water outlet is provided at the rear of the cylinder head and is a press-fit pipe type.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>A wax type thermostat with a bypass valve and a large flange diameter (56mm) has been adopted to ensure sufficient coolant circulation.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
<SPEC ID = "T010256A147X01" INDSW = "OFF">
<TITLE>Thermostat Specifications</TITLE>
<TABLE FRAME = "ALL" COLSEP = "1" ROWSEP = "1">
<TGROUP COLS = "2" COLSEP = "1" ROWSEP = "1" TGROUPSTYLE = "Table_01">
